      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "originalText": "PutItem Orders: {OrderId: \"O-123\", Status: \"PAID\"}\nMREC: write succeeds in us-east-1, then propagates to us-west-2.\nA GetItem in us-west-2 can briefly return the previous committed value.",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "mrsc_note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 650,
      "y": 1125,
      "width": 1320,
      "height": 67.5,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "text": "MRSC alternative (not drawn): synchronous cross-Region replication; supports strongly consistent reads.\nRequires exactly THREE participating Regions: three replicas, or two replicas plus a witness.\nA witness is not an application read/write endpoint.",
      "seed": 400009,
      "angle": 0,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
